WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.009
RICHARD MADDEN
Hey, everyone! We're from the cast of

00:00:02.059 --> 00:00:03.070
Marvel Studios' Eternals...

00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:05.230
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
...and our Marvel knowledge is about to be

00:00:05.281 --> 00:00:09.525
tested with a little game of
True or False: Marvel Edition.

00:00:14.453 --> 00:00:15.364
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
That's true.

00:00:15.414 --> 00:00:16.185
GEMMA CHAN
It's false.

00:00:16.235 --> 00:00:17.177
KUMAIL NANJIANI
No! It's this.

00:00:17.227 --> 00:00:18.158
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
It's false?

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.080
KUMAIL NANJIANI
[Laughing]

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.042
KINGO [in sign language]
Nice move.

00:00:23.092 --> 00:00:24.123
MAKKARI [in sign language]
You, too.

00:00:26.404 --> 00:00:28.151
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
This is incredibly specific.

00:00:28.201 --> 00:00:29.534
GEMMA CHAN
False...

00:00:30.662 --> 00:00:31.284
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Oh!

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:32.151
- Yes!
- Yes!

00:00:32.201 --> 00:00:32.752
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
False!

00:00:32.802 --> 00:00:35.268
RICHARD MADDEN
Ah! I'm not good at left and right.

00:00:35.318 --> 00:00:36.732
KINGO
That explains so much.

00:00:40.631 --> 00:00:43.290
KUMAIL NANJIANI
I hope it's not, so I'm gonna say false.

00:00:43.341 --> 00:00:44.081
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
[Laughing] It's true!

00:00:44.131 --> 00:00:45.224
RICHARD MADDEN
I'm going with Gemma.

00:00:45.275 --> 00:00:46.145
SPRITE
It's true, buddy.

00:00:46.196 --> 00:00:47.581
EVERYONE
Oh!

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:49.148
CLINT BARTON
What? You didn't see that coming?

00:00:55.675 --> 00:00:56.703
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
All the J.A.R.V.I.S.'s I know,

00:00:56.753 --> 00:00:57.675
that's what it stands for.

00:00:57.725 --> 00:00:58.909
RICHARD MADDEN
I'm gonna say false.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.827
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Secret nerd, Lauren.

00:01:04.777 --> 00:01:05.534
KUMAIL NANJIANI
True!

00:01:05.585 --> 00:01:06.648
- I'm gonna say true.
- They were pals.

00:01:06.698 --> 00:01:08.120
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
That's a hard false.

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:08.792
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Ah!

00:01:08.842 --> 00:01:09.487
IKARIS
Ouch.

00:01:09.537 --> 00:01:10.846
KUMAIL NANJIANI
No. You know what, they're wrong.

00:01:10.896 --> 00:01:11.537
I'm right.

00:01:11.587 --> 00:01:12.229
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Unbelievable.

00:01:12.279 --> 00:01:13.042
GEMMA CHAN
[Laughing]

00:01:13.092 --> 00:01:13.958
RICHARD MADDEN
Next question.

00:01:15.935 --> 00:01:16.807
GEMMA CHAN
I'm going with true.

00:01:16.857 --> 00:01:18.510
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Yup, all of that is true.

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:23.682
KINGO
Hey, that one was mine! Oh, nevermind.

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:25.684
SALMA HAYEK
And they're gonna love it!

00:01:26.312 --> 00:01:27.645
RICHARD MADDEN
True. I'm gonna say true.

